SUMMARY:Toronto Cactus and Succulent Club Plant Sale
DESCRIPTION:The Toronto Cactus and Succulent Club (TCSC) is pleased to invite you to our annual autumn Display & Sale\, a favourite event for plant enthusiasts. The event will be held in the Floral Hall.  \n\n\n\nFor those who were unable to attend the June Show & Sale\, here is your chance to make amends.  \n\n\n\nJoin us to spend the day enjoying an impressive display of unique plants from around the world\, expert guidance from experienced growers\, and the opportunity to connect with fellow enthusiasts. \n\n\n\nA wide selection of cacti and succulents will be available for purchase\, including many varieties not commonly found elsewhere. Whether you are an experienced collector or new to these fascinating plants\, there is something for everyone. \n\n\n\nWe hope to see you there! \n\n\n\nSunday\, September 27th\, from 10:00 a.m. to 4:00 p.m.\n\n\n\nAdmission is free. \n\n\n\nJoin Toronto Botanical Garden\n\n\n\nJoin the Toronto Botanical Garden (TBG) as a member to get a discount on this program\, upcoming events and classes\, and free parking. A TBG membership helps you deepen your knowledge and connection to the natural world\, become a part of a dynamic community of plant people\, and be inspired! Become a member! \n\n\n\nAdditional Program Information\n\n\n\n\nPlease review our Refund Policy and Terms of Agreement.\n\n\n\nFor more information on accessibility at the garden please review our Accessibility Features webpage. If you have any accessibility requirements during your program please email programsupport@torontobotanicalgarden.ca.\n\n\n\nTo learn more about the Toronto Botanical Garden and our programs\, please review our list of Frequently Asked Questions.
